In this challenge, we're going to use loops to help us do some simple math.
program :
import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        int n = sc.nextInt();

        for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {
            System.out.println(n + " x " + i + " = " + (n * i));
        }

        sc.close();
    }
}
